WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.803
-President Trump allegedly
pressured the leader of Ukraine

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.538
to interfere
in the 2020 election

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.740
by spreading misinformation
about Joe Biden.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.610
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.713
♪♪

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.315
-First, let's step back
and remember how we got here.

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:18.384
You might remember
that earlier this year

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.853
in an interview with
George Stephanopoulos on ABC,

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:23.823
Trump said straight-up
he would openly accept the help

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.959
of a foreign government
in the 2020 campaign

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.127
if they offered dirt
on an opponent.

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:29.695
-Let's put yourself
in a position.

00:00:29.695 --> 00:00:31.798
You're a Congressman.
Somebody comes up and says,

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:34.266
"Hey, I have information
on your opponent."

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:35.735
Do you call the FBI?

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:37.636
-If it's coming
from Russia, you do.

00:00:37.636 --> 00:00:39.171
-I've seen a lot of things
over my life.

00:00:39.171 --> 00:00:41.174
I don't think in my whole life
I've ever called the FBI.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.843
In my whole life.
You don't call the FBI.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.144
This is somebody that said,

00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:47.313
"We have information
on your opponent."

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:50.150
Oh, let me call the FBI.
Give me a break.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.551
Life doesn't work that way.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:55.121
-No. YOUR life
doesn't work that way.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:58.057
Noncriminal lives'
DO work that way.

00:00:58.057 --> 00:00:59.793
You, on the other hand,
have no shame.

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:01.027
If a mobster called up Trump

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:02.895
and said, "Let's meet
down by the docks,"

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:04.029
I can't imagine him going,

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:06.199
"Oh, no, I better run this
by my lawyer.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:09.002
Quick. Someone knock
on Rudy's coffin!"

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.904
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:13.039
And, of course,
you wouldn't call the FBI.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.240
You're the criminal.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.709
The only contact Trump
has ever had with the FBI

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:20.713
is via notes with letters
cut out from magazines.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.014
Again, Trump went out of his way

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:23.716
to tell everyone
on national television

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.851
that if he could get
a foreign country to interfere

00:01:25.851 --> 00:01:26.953
in the 2020 election

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:28.954
by giving him dirt
on a political opponent,

00:01:28.954 --> 00:01:30.690
he would absolutely do it.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.926
-Your campaign this time around,
if foreigners,

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.460
if Russia, if China,
if someone else

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.028
offers you information
on an opponent,

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:38.031
should they accept it
or should they call the FBI?

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:40.466
-I think maybe you do both.

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:42.468
I think you might
want to listen.

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:44.136
I don't -- There's nothing wrong
with listening.

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:48.508
If somebody called
from a country -- Norway.

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:50.977
"We have information
on your opponent."

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:52.711
Oh. I think I'd want to hear it.

00:01:52.711 --> 00:01:54.647
-You want that kind of
interference in our elections?

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:56.582
-It's not an interference.
They have information.

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:57.983
I think I'd take it.

00:01:57.983 --> 00:02:01.220
-Yeah, we know you'd take it
because you already took it.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.490
What's even the point of asking
Trump these questions anymore?

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.258
It's like rolling in
Hannibal Lecter and saying,

00:02:06.258 --> 00:02:10.663
"Okay, if we let you go, are
you gonna eat any more guys?

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:13.299
Also, I cannot help but notice
that you're licking your lips

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.801
while I'm asking this question."

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.337
And this is where things
started to get even crazier.

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:18.771
About a month
before that interview,

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.873
Trump's lawyer Rudy Giuliani
announced that he was planning

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:23.243
a trip to Ukraine
to push for investigations

00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:26.079
that would help Trump by getting
that country's new government

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:29.214
to dig up dirt on the origins
of the Russia investigation

00:02:29.214 --> 00:02:31.717
and the family of
Democratic candidate Joe Biden.

00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:34.620
Now, after an outcry,
Rudy canceled the trip,

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.690
and after he did that, he went
on Fox News to explain himself.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.025
And by explaining himself,

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:40.793
I mean he did
what he always does --

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:44.130
he made it much worse
by explaining hypothetically

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:48.268
how he could meddle in the 2020
election if he wanted to.

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:51.036
-The election in 2020
is a long time from now.

00:02:51.036 --> 00:02:53.540
And If I wanted to meddle
in that election, which I don't,

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.608
I could have held for this
for a year

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.910
and dropped it
right before the convention.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:01.480
-"If I wanted to meddle in
this election, which I don't,"

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:02.882
is not convincing

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:05.285
when you've put so much thought
into how you would do it.

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:07.420
"If I was going to Ukraine,
which I'm not.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.555
I'd fly American,
I'd connect through Heathrow,

00:03:09.555 --> 00:03:11.957
I'd bring noise-canceling
headphones, a nice neck pillow,

00:03:11.957 --> 00:03:15.661
'cause I want to be well-rested
for the meddling."

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:17.263
But once again,
Rudy also accidentally

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:18.731
said something
very incriminating.

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:21.134
As the Fox anchor was trying
to get him to end the interview,

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:23.202
Rudy just casually
threw out the idea

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:25.804
that if Congress called him
to testify about this,

00:03:25.804 --> 00:03:27.739
he would cite
executive privilege,

00:03:27.739 --> 00:03:28.908
which would imply that

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:30.910
he's spoken directly
to the President

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.412
about this attempt to interfere
in the 2020 election.

00:03:33.412 --> 00:03:36.382
And when Rudy said that, even
the Fox anchor was taken aback

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.383
by the fact that Rudy
was making news.

00:03:38.383 --> 00:03:39.618
-All right, Mr. Mayor.

00:03:39.618 --> 00:03:41.554
Please keep us in touch
with what's going on,

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:43.122
but for now
we'll let the world know

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:45.024
you're not headed to Ukraine.
-I'm not going.

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:46.926
And so they can call me...
We're out of time.

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:49.862
-And maybe I'll take executive
privilege or something.

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:52.698
-Oh, boy. Oh, boy. You're making
another headline tonight.

00:03:52.698 --> 00:03:54.800
Uh, Mr. Mayor.
Thank you for dropping in.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.102
-But they are really pathetic.

00:03:57.102 --> 00:03:58.570
-We got to go.
-And they're scared.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.306
And they're on defense.
-All right. We got to go.

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:01.907
Thank you for dropping in.
Great to see you.

00:04:01.907 --> 00:04:05.144
-Only, only, only on Fox News
do they follow,

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:07.780
"Oh, boy,
you're making headlines,"

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:11.083
with, "Well, we gotta go."

00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:15.454
It was like the director
was in the booth screaming,

00:04:15.454 --> 00:04:16.955
"Go to commercial!

00:04:16.955 --> 00:04:20.859
Go to commercial
before journalism happens!"

00:04:20.859 --> 00:04:23.762
So, just to recap, that's where
things stood before last week.

00:04:23.762 --> 00:04:26.198
The President said in public
that he would welcome

00:04:26.198 --> 00:04:29.234
the help of a foreign government
interfering in the 2020 election

00:04:29.234 --> 00:04:31.604
and his personal lawyer
was trying to get Ukraine

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:33.039
to do exactly that.

00:04:33.039 --> 00:04:34.974
And then things got
even more suspicious.

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:36.375
For example,
it was reported in August

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:38.644
that Trump was
seriously considering blocking

00:04:38.644 --> 00:04:41.147
$250 million
in military aid to Ukraine.

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:43.015
And then last week, we found out

00:04:43.015 --> 00:04:46.119
that in a phone call
with an unnamed foreign leader,

00:04:46.119 --> 00:04:48.921
Trump had made a promise that
was regarded as so troubling

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:50.322
that it prompted an official

00:04:50.322 --> 00:04:52.157
in the U.S.
intelligence community

00:04:52.157 --> 00:04:53.793
to file
a whistleblower complaint.

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.060
So an intelligence official

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.896
who heard Trump's promise
on the call

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:58.898
found it so alarming,
they reported it.

00:04:58.898 --> 00:05:00.966
Now, at first,
Trump's only response to this

00:05:00.966 --> 00:05:03.235
was to insist that he would
never be stupid enough

00:05:03.235 --> 00:05:04.904
to make such an illicit promise

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:07.340
on a phone call when
other people were listening.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.575
-He tweeted his first response,
writing,

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:12.111
"Another fake news story
out there. It never ends.

00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:14.880
Virtually any time I speak on
the phone to a foreign leader,

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.150
I understand that there will be
many people listening

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:18.851
from various U.S. agencies,

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:20.986
not to mention from
the other country itself.

00:05:20.986 --> 00:05:22.521
No problem."
And then he goes on to say,

00:05:22.521 --> 00:05:24.523
"Knowing all of this,
is anybody dumb enough

00:05:24.523 --> 00:05:26.792
to believe that I would say
something inappropriate

00:05:26.792 --> 00:05:28.227
with a foreign leader

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:31.130
while on such a potentially
heavily populated call?"

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.099
-Of course, you would say
something inappropriate.

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:35.934
You are always saying
something inappropriate.

00:05:35.934 --> 00:05:38.637
You have no filter and no
ability to restrain yourself.

00:05:38.637 --> 00:05:41.874
Just last week when you were
touring your stupid border wall,

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:44.443
you blurted out something
about the technology

00:05:44.443 --> 00:05:47.146
built into the wall that even
one of your own officials said

00:05:47.146 --> 00:05:48.647
should be kept a secret.

00:05:48.647 --> 00:05:50.916
-One thing we haven't mentioned
is technology.

00:05:50.916 --> 00:05:52.718
They're wired
so that we will know

00:05:52.718 --> 00:05:54.186
if somebody's
trying to break through,

00:05:54.186 --> 00:05:56.155
and you may want to discuss
that a little bit, General.

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:58.123
-Sir, there could be some merit
in not discussing that.

00:05:58.123 --> 00:06:03.229
-Okay. I like that.
That was a great answer.

00:06:03.229 --> 00:06:05.297
I'll just tell you
they're wired.

00:06:05.297 --> 00:06:07.399
-So that guy...

00:06:07.399 --> 00:06:09.702
That guy just said, "Don't
tell him about the wires."

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:12.437
And your response was,
"Cool, cool, cool, cool.

00:06:12.437 --> 00:06:16.509
But, uh, just saying,
though, they're wired."

00:06:16.509 --> 00:06:18.043
I think your brain is wired.

00:06:18.043 --> 00:06:20.345
Just the wires
aren't in the right order.

00:06:20.345 --> 00:06:22.681
I mean, he did that in front
of cameras and microphones,

00:06:22.681 --> 00:06:25.217
so I have no problem believing
that Trump would try to extort

00:06:25.217 --> 00:06:27.186
a foreign leader
with other people listening.

00:06:27.186 --> 00:06:28.788
That would not be
surprising at all.

00:06:28.788 --> 00:06:30.356
And sure enough,
over the weekend,

00:06:30.356 --> 00:06:32.291
we found out that not only
did Trump pressure

00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:34.860
the president of Ukraine into
investigating Biden and his son,

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:37.162
he did it over and over
and over again.

00:06:37.162 --> 00:06:39.732
-President Trump urging
the president of Ukraine

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:44.403
to investigate Joe Biden's son,
Hunter, multiple times.

00:06:44.403 --> 00:06:46.405
That's according to
"The Wall Street Journal"

00:06:46.405 --> 00:06:48.273
in a breaking news story
just minutes ago.

00:06:48.273 --> 00:06:50.442
Sources telling "The Journal"
that President Trump

00:06:50.442 --> 00:06:53.446
made the request about eight
times on a July phone call.

00:06:53.446 --> 00:06:56.048
-He brought it up eight times
on one phone call.

00:06:56.048 --> 00:06:58.951
Eight times makes it seem like
a pretty obvious crime.

00:06:58.951 --> 00:07:01.653
It's like if you went on trial
for stabbing a guy

00:07:01.653 --> 00:07:04.690
and said, "It was an accident,
he fell on the knife."

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.293
And they said, "Eight times?!"

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:10.563
"Yeah.
He was wearing roller skates."

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:11.930
Now, that report came after

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.466
Trump's lawyer Rudy Giuliani
had all but confessed

00:07:14.466 --> 00:07:16.569
in an insane meltdown on CNN.

00:07:16.569 --> 00:07:19.138
In fact, at one point
during the interview,

00:07:19.138 --> 00:07:20.940
Rudy went from denying the story

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:23.709
to admitting it
like 30 seconds later.

00:07:23.709 --> 00:07:26.245
-Did you ask the Ukraine
to investigate Joe Biden?

00:07:26.245 --> 00:07:28.380
-No. Actually I didn't.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.682
I asked the Ukraine
to investigate the allegations

00:07:30.682 --> 00:07:34.420
that there was interference
in the election of 2016

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.489
by the Ukrainians for the
benefit of Hillary Clinton

00:07:37.489 --> 00:07:38.925
for which there already is --

00:07:38.925 --> 00:07:40.960
-You never asked anything
about Hunter Biden?

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.828
You never asked
anything about Joe Biden?

00:07:42.828 --> 00:07:45.030
-The only thing
I asked about Joe Biden

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.833
is to get to the bottom
of how it was that Lutsenko,

00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:51.771
who was appointed,
dismissed the case against --

00:07:51.771 --> 00:07:53.739
-So you did ask Ukraine
to look into Joe Biden.

00:07:53.739 --> 00:07:55.374
-Of course I did!

00:07:55.374 --> 00:07:56.575
-What?

00:07:56.575 --> 00:07:58.610
You just said -- You j--

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:01.613
-I've seen witnesses break down
under cross-examination,

00:08:01.613 --> 00:08:04.517
but never the lawyer.

00:08:04.517 --> 00:08:06.218
Sometimes I can't decide
with Rudy

00:08:06.218 --> 00:08:07.853
if he's really
a confused old man

00:08:07.853 --> 00:08:10.222
or if it's all
an intentional strategy

00:08:10.222 --> 00:08:13.859
that he keeps [bleep] up
because he's a confused old man.

00:08:13.859 --> 00:08:16.529
It was sometimes impossible
to follow

00:08:16.529 --> 00:08:18.831
Rudy's logic and syntax
in this interview.

00:08:18.831 --> 00:08:21.367
Just watch as, within
the span of one sentence,

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:23.202
he calls the allegation
ridiculous,

00:08:23.202 --> 00:08:26.738
says he's proud of it,
then calls it ridiculous again.

00:08:26.738 --> 00:08:29.341
-You want to cover
some ridiculous charge

00:08:29.341 --> 00:08:31.977
that I urged
the Ukrainian government

00:08:31.977 --> 00:08:33.813
to investigate corruption.

00:08:33.813 --> 00:08:35.715
Well, I did,
and I'm proud of it.

00:08:35.715 --> 00:08:37.716
-Well, then, it's not
a ridiculous allegation.

00:08:37.716 --> 00:08:39.951
You just admitted it.
-It's a ridiculous allegation.

00:08:40.018 --> 00:08:41.687
-You just admitted it.
-It's a ridiculous allegation.

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:44.490
-Rudy, you just admitted
that you did it.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.258
-I mean, that's like

00:08:46.258 --> 00:08:48.527
the easiest interview
Chris Cuomo has ever done.

00:08:48.527 --> 00:08:50.229
He doesn't even
need to be there.

00:08:50.229 --> 00:08:52.231
Just put Rudy
on both sides of the screen

00:08:52.231 --> 00:08:53.999
and let him debate himself.

00:08:53.999 --> 00:08:56.202
"It's a ridiculous allegation!
But you said you did it!

00:08:56.202 --> 00:08:58.070
I did, and I'm proud of it!"

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.773
Cuomo also tried to point out
that Rudy had

00:09:00.773 --> 00:09:03.342
contradicted himself,
but Rudy denied it.

00:09:03.342 --> 00:09:04.609
-Rudy, I have no problem

00:09:04.609 --> 00:09:06.511
with you launching
the allegations,

00:09:06.511 --> 00:09:08.580
but just be careful
about what you say.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:11.450
I asked you, "Did you ask
Ukraine to look at Joe Biden?"

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:15.521
You said no. Then you went on
to say that you did.

00:09:15.521 --> 00:09:17.623
-No, I didn't say that.
-It's all recorded.

00:09:17.623 --> 00:09:19.725
-"Recorded?!"

00:09:19.725 --> 00:09:23.462
[ Laughter ]

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:27.466
"Ohh! I thought
we were having dinner.

00:09:27.466 --> 00:09:30.002
This isn't Tavern on the Green?!

00:09:30.002 --> 00:09:33.905
I've been eating a steak
this whole time!"

00:09:33.905 --> 00:09:35.807
And, of course,
because Rudy was making

00:09:35.807 --> 00:09:37.977
wild and baseless accusations
about Joe Biden

00:09:37.977 --> 00:09:40.445
and Ukrainians somehow colluding
with Hillary Clinton

00:09:40.445 --> 00:09:42.615
to set up a rigged investigation
or whatever,

00:09:42.615 --> 00:09:44.349
Cuomo asked him
for, you know, proof,

00:09:44.349 --> 00:09:46.018
and, of course,
Rudy could not provide any.

00:09:46.018 --> 00:09:47.619
-And you know what
you're gonna find out?

00:09:47.619 --> 00:09:50.422
It was the Ukrainian collusion
with Hillary Clinton.

00:09:50.422 --> 00:09:52.925
-Look. You want to give me
the proof, that's fine.

00:09:52.925 --> 00:09:54.627
-I don't have to
give you the proof.

00:09:54.627 --> 00:09:56.729
-I'm not saying you have to.
It would be nice.

00:09:56.729 --> 00:09:58.530
-It's written!
You just won't read it!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:01.000
It's all over the Internet!
Go read it.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.070
-That does not mean anything.
Everything is on the Internet.

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.438
You can probably find
a listicle called

00:10:06.438 --> 00:10:09.742
"30 times Rudy sat on his balls"
on the Internet.

00:10:09.742 --> 00:10:12.511
Doesn't mean it's true.

00:10:12.511 --> 00:10:15.047
Then at one point, this
interview got so off the rails

00:10:15.047 --> 00:10:17.482
that Cuomo and Rudy were
just shouting at each other

00:10:17.482 --> 00:10:20.419
after Rudy said Cuomo was biased
and called him a sellout.

00:10:20.419 --> 00:10:21.987
-You want to distort
what I'm saying,

00:10:21.987 --> 00:10:23.188
because you're totally biased.

00:10:23.188 --> 00:10:24.990
-I'm not biased.
-You are, Chris. It's sad.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.692
-Why I would have you on
if I were biased

00:10:26.692 --> 00:10:28.994
knowing that we were gonna have
this kind of conversation?

00:10:28.994 --> 00:10:31.697
-Because it is sad to watch
what happened to you. It's sad.

00:10:31.697 --> 00:10:34.833
-Sad what happened to me?
I'm a sellout?

00:10:34.833 --> 00:10:36.068
-You are a sellout.

00:10:36.068 --> 00:10:38.003
-YOU are telling ME
that I'm a sellout?

00:10:38.003 --> 00:10:40.372
-[ Shouting ]

00:10:40.372 --> 00:10:41.907
If you guys
are gonna talk like that,

00:10:41.907 --> 00:10:44.843
we're gonna have to move this
interview to a butcher shop!

00:10:44.843 --> 00:10:48.047
And invite Joe Pesci."

00:10:48.047 --> 00:10:50.249
So, knowing the damage
had been done,

00:10:50.249 --> 00:10:53.452
Rudy had to once again engage
in this ritual walk of shame

00:10:53.452 --> 00:10:58.023
from the CNN studios
over to the Fox News studios,

00:10:58.023 --> 00:11:00.192
where they played
his CNN interview for him,

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:03.562
made him watch it, and tried
to get him to explain it.

00:11:03.562 --> 00:11:06.731
And I love that Rudy
tried to pull a Clark Kent

00:11:06.731 --> 00:11:09.501
and put on glasses...

00:11:09.501 --> 00:11:12.304
so that people would think
he was a different guy.

00:11:12.304 --> 00:11:13.806
"No.

00:11:13.806 --> 00:11:15.340
No, watching this tape,

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.576
I don't know who
that lunatic is,

00:11:17.576 --> 00:11:22.914
but he's speaking nonsense
and he should be fired."

00:11:22.914 --> 00:11:23.983
Now, once we started

00:11:23.983 --> 00:11:25.551
to find out the truth
of what happened,

00:11:25.551 --> 00:11:26.719
the same routine played out

00:11:26.719 --> 00:11:28.620
that has happened
with previous Trump crimes.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.422
First, he denied it,
then he admitted it,

00:11:30.422 --> 00:11:31.690
and basically said, "So what?"

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.692
Watch the progression
of Trump's changing story

00:11:33.692 --> 00:11:35.494
from Friday morning
to Sunday morning

00:11:35.494 --> 00:11:36.828
to later that same Sunday.

00:11:36.828 --> 00:11:39.531
-Did you discuss Joe Biden,
his son, or his family?

00:11:39.531 --> 00:11:41.400
-It doesn't matter
what I discussed.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.203
I had a great conversation
with numerous people.

00:11:44.203 --> 00:11:46.104
I don't even know exactly
who you're talking about.

00:11:46.104 --> 00:11:52.511
-The conversation I had
was largely congratulatory.

00:11:52.511 --> 00:11:55.447
It was largely the fact
that we don't want our people

00:11:55.447 --> 00:11:59.051
like Vice President Biden
and his son

00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:03.088
creating to the corruption
already in the Ukraine.

00:12:03.088 --> 00:12:04.756
But just so you understand,

00:12:04.756 --> 00:12:08.293
the conversation I had
with the president of Ukraine

00:12:08.293 --> 00:12:10.595
was absolutely perfect.

00:12:10.595 --> 00:12:12.865
-...on this call, did you raise

00:12:12.865 --> 00:12:15.534
Joe Biden or his son's name
with Ukraine?

00:12:15.534 --> 00:12:17.035
-Well, I don't even
want to mention it,

00:12:17.035 --> 00:12:18.704
but certainly
I'd have every right to.

00:12:18.704 --> 00:12:20.572
And there was no pressure,
no nothing.

00:12:20.572 --> 00:12:23.575
There was no pressure.
Uh, that was not pressure.

00:12:23.575 --> 00:12:26.779
I know when I give pressure.
And that was not pressure.

00:12:26.779 --> 00:12:30.115
-So he went from "it doesn't
matter what I discussed"

00:12:30.115 --> 00:12:31.850
to "I don't want
to talk about it"

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.218
to "we talked about Biden"

00:12:33.218 --> 00:12:34.686
to "it was
a perfect conversation"

00:12:34.686 --> 00:12:36.321
to "if I did talk about Biden,

00:12:36.321 --> 00:12:38.223
then I'd have the right
to talk about Biden"

00:12:38.223 --> 00:12:39.658
to "I didn't pressure anyone."

00:12:39.658 --> 00:12:41.560
I can't believe I'm saying this,

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:44.596
but maybe you should let Rudy
step in here.

00:12:44.596 --> 00:12:47.299
The President of the United
States allegedly used his power

00:12:47.299 --> 00:12:49.868
to extort a foreign leader
to meddle in the 2020 election

00:12:49.868 --> 00:12:52.437
on his behalf, and his
rabies-brain vampire lawyer

00:12:52.437 --> 00:12:54.306
is going on TV
and admitting to it.

00:12:54.306 --> 00:12:56.575
If this isn't impeachable
behavior, I don't know what is.

00:12:56.575 --> 00:12:58.443
The House should impeach him
immediately, or,

00:12:58.443 --> 00:13:01.045
at the very least,
someone should pick up
the phone and say...

00:13:01.045 --> 00:13:03.515
-Oh, let me call the FBI.

00:13:03.515 --> 00:13:05.551
-This has been "A Closer Look."

